      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ypsilanti%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ypsilanti’s Water Tower, built in 1890, is a distinctive phallic landmark overlooking the Huron River.",
